    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents are delighted to present 110 Hazelwood Park to the sales market. This solidly built 4 bedroomed family home offers deceptively spacious & versatile accommodation extending to c. 132sq.m. The property enjoys an attractive position overlooking a green to front and also has a large garden to rear with a concrete built multi purpose unit suitable for a variety of uses, home office, gym or hobby room. Benefiting from an open plan kitchen/dining area, downstairs bedroom with ensuite and the potential for a double extension should additional accommodation be required. Hazelwood is a very popular & sought after residential location due to its settled nature and its convenience to established amenities. The property will appeal to first time buyers & young families looking to up size in the locality. Viewing highly recommended. \n\nThe location offers a wealth of amenities including excellent primary and secondary schools, sporting facilities including GAA, Soccer and shopping facilities at nearby Artane Castle Shopping Centre and Omni Shopping Centre. The property is a short stroll from Beaumont Hospital and within ease of access of the M1/M50 motorways and is easily accessed by public transport with numerous bus routes serving the immediate area and a Dublin Bus corridor on the Malahide Road. For the Outdoor/Sporting enthusiasts, St. Anne`s Park, Coastal promenade/cycle track & Dollymount Strand are all only a short drive away."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch Entrance\n\nReception Hall\nUnder stairs storage. Tiled flooring.\n\nLounge - 3.83m (12'7\") x 3.76m (12'4\")\nCast iron fireplace with marble surround. Tiled flooring.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 4.92m (16'2\") x 3.11m (10'2\")\nRange of fitted press units. Under counter lighting. Tiled behind worktop. Granite worktop. Plumbed for dishwasher. Tiled floor. Recessed lighting. Oven, hob and extractor fan included in sale.\n\nFamily Room - 4.4m (14'5\") x 3.63m (11'11\")\nCast iron fireplace with timber surround. Tiled flooring. PVC doors to rear.\n\nLobby Area - 2.34m (7'8\") x 1.6m (5'3\")\nPVC door to rear.\n\nBedroom 4 - 5.51m (18'1\") x 3.73m (12'3\")\nLaminate floor. Ensuite: Electric shower, whb and wc. Fully tiled floor & walls.\n\nLanding\nPull down attic ladder. Hotpress with insulated immersion tank.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.92m (12'10\") x 3.46m (11'4\")\nBuilt in wardrobes. Varnished floorboards.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.26m (14'0\") x 3.42m (11'3\")\nVarnished floorboards.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.95m (9'8\") x 2.45m (8'0\")\nVarnished floorboards.\n\nShower Room\nShower tray, screen, whb and wc. Fully tiled floor & walls. Timber ceiling. Recessed lighting.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> PVC double glazed windows </li><li> Gas central heating </li><li> Overlooking a green </li><li> Utility shed plumbed for washing machine </li><li> Outside wc </li><li> Detached garden studio to rear with power/water suitable for many uses </li><li> Large rear garden with North West orientation </li><li> Side entrance </li><li> Desirable location</li></ul>"
      },
